
Please do a FidoNet File-Send to 1:2410/207.
The top of the file should contain info about your BBS.
The remainder of the file should contain "totals info" about your system.

Example:

>                       Amiga ShareWare HeadQuarters
>                Bill Beogelein, Box 530441, Livonia, MI 48153
>                             810-473-2020
>        300/1200/2400/9600/14.4k/19.2k/HST/v32/v32bis/v42/v42bis/MNP
>             FidoNet:  1:2410/207         Echo TagName: SWHQ_BBS
> 
> Active Users:    148                     Public Msgs Posted: 41,248
> Total Calls :  1,002                     Public Msgs Online: 19,220
>                       
> Doors Run   :  1,732                     Text Items Read   :  1,119
> Doors Online:     28                     Text Items Online :    177
> 
> Files U/Led :  6,231 @ 288meg            Email Msgs Sent   :  1,367
> Files D/Led :  1,017 @  69meg            Email Msgs Online :    146
> Files Online:  4,673                     Phone Lines       :      2

(If you are a CNet-BBS all of the above info can be generated
automatically with a file called "MCItotals.LHA".)

The following rules apply:
1)  Only Fidonet "File Sends" will be accepted.
    (You can't call and UL directly.)
2)  Your file must be called "TOTALS_ZONE_NET_NODE.txt".
    (If your Fidonet address is 1:2410/207, the file you send should be
    called "TOTALS_1_2410_207.txt".)
3)  Your file must be between 300-1000 bytes long.
    (All other file sizes are automatically deleted.)
4)  You can re-send an updated version of your totals at any time.
5)  Your file should be a straight ASCII text-file and NOT be compressed.

All files that meet the above requirements are automatically added into
an archive each midnight.  You can File Requ' this archive with the
MagicName "TOTALS" from 1:2410/207 at 14.4k.

